[MODULES] Use with include <module.scad>:

1. rounded_cube([width,depth,height], radius, facets)
   // facets=16; rounded_cube([8,8,8],1,facets);

2. Gridfinity System Modules:
   base_lid(num_x, num_y) - Create lid for Gridfinity base with magnet pockets
   weighted_baseplate(num_x, num_y) - Create weighted baseplate with magnet and screw holes
   frame_plain(num_x, num_y, extra_down=0, trim=0) - Create plain frame for Gridfinity system

   // Examples:
 // Plain 3x3 frame use by default as gridfinity base unless magnet or screw required 
   frame_plain(3, 3); 
    // Weighted Gridfinity  baseplate with magnet holes
   weighted_baseplate(4, 2);

